WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.084
You don't drink coffee? 

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:01.376
No.

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:03.253
I don't trust anybody
 who doesn't drink coffee.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.130
Yeah, I don’t-

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:06.047
This interview is over.

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:07.173
(laughs)

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.634
My name is Nick Barili,
 and I'm traveling the country

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:11.302
to sit down with some 
of the biggest Latinx artists 

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:13.221
in places that have
meanting to them 

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:14.556
and help tell their stories. 

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:17.308
This was probably the 
place I grew most.

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:18.977
This whole movement 

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:21.896
is to make sure
 that we do learn our history.

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:24.399
This is baile folklórico. 

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:27.193
My family was under
 five different flags

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:29.821
without ever moving.
 I'm ninth generation American.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.906
I never crossed a border.
 The border crossed us.

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:35.201
When people go “go home,” 
we are home.

00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:35.744
This is home. 

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:36.536
This is home.

00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:39.539
This is the only way that you're

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.833
going to break through
 as a new show or a movie

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.460
is through innovation, 

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.629
and the only way innovation
 happens is by diversity.

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:49.507
And so you can't keep going
 back to that same talent pool

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:51.551
because you're going
 to get the same movie. 

00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:53.053
You're never too old to learn. 

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.012
You're never too old 

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:57.515
to finish something or to 
go back and do something.

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:59.142
I'm going to do this.
 I can do this. 

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:00.602
I did it, you know?

